Package: caboose-computer-use-wine
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Braedon Saunders <bsaunders@rassaun.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: caboose-computer-use, wine
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/braedonsaunders/caboose
Description: Caboose computer use: the Wine applications' accessibility reader
 caboose-msaa.exe, run under Wine in an application's prefix, reads a Windows
 program's controls through MSAA and UI Automation for the caboose-computer-use
 tools, which have no AT-SPI tree for it.
